    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Farm of the unseen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the horrors lurking in the heart of the countryside in this unsettling survival horror. Explore a seemingly peaceful rural landscape, filled with serene lakes and idyllic fields, but concealing unfathomable terrors within its depths. Solve challenging puzzles to unravel the mysteries of this singular farm while being hunted by abominable beings. Each encounter will test your wit, strategy, and composure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845950/extras/f708e6282f0193c7b61dce5ce0e8988a.poster.avif?t=1751747668\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845950/extras/f708e6282f0193c7b61dce5ce0e8988a.webm?t=1751747668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845950/extras/f708e6282f0193c7b61dce5ce0e8988a.mp4?t=1751747668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Farm of the Unseen is alive, and every decision could be your last. Will you dare to uncover the secrets it hides?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The unseen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange beings inhabit this farm, known as the unseen: enigmatic entities from another time, another world. These beings possess unsettling powers, capable of baffling even the sharpest minds. To face their complex mechanics, you must study them carefully. Each one holds its own story. Perhaps by understanding their turbulent past, you will unravel their mysteries and anticipate their behaviours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845950/extras/85c478ac5d199e2b99d2c4cd66d8b9b5.poster.avif?t=1751747668\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845950/extras/85c478ac5d199e2b99d2c4cd66d8b9b5.webm?t=1751747668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845950/extras/85c478ac5d199e2b99d2c4cd66d8b9b5.mp4?t=1751747668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory:</strong> Collect and utilize a variety of items, codex notes, keys, and gear. The selection of items you come across may differ from what others find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845950/extras/b26bf65007ae26d7e818e1ac3d289275.poster.avif?t=1751747668\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845950/extras/b26bf65007ae26d7e818e1ac3d289275.webm?t=1751747668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845950/extras/b26bf65007ae26d7e818e1ac3d289275.mp4?t=1751747668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845950/extras/3615807b8ae5995513ae3d1c5b65dbcf.poster.avif?t=1751747668\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845950/extras/3615807b8ae5995513ae3d1c5b65dbcf.webm?t=1751747668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845950/extras/3615807b8ae5995513ae3d1c5b65dbcf.mp4?t=1751747668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The unseen:</strong> Encounter and endure the distinct behaviours and challenges posed by each being.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845950/extras/3833b9921f7d990468c737e8ae58574c.poster.avif?t=1751747668\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845950/extras/3833b9921f7d990468c737e8ae58574c.webm?t=1751747668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845950/extras/3833b9921f7d990468c737e8ae58574c.mp4?t=1751747668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Farm of the unseen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the horrors lurking in the heart of the countryside in this unsettling survival horror. Explore a seemingly peaceful rural landscape, filled with serene lakes and idyllic fields, but concealing unfathomable terrors within its depths. Solve challenging puzzles to unravel the mysteries of this singular farm while being hunted by abominable beings. Each encounter will test your wit, strategy, and composure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845950/extras/f708e6282f0193c7b61dce5ce0e8988a.poster.avif?t=1751747668\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845950/extras/f708e6282f0193c7b61dce5ce0e8988a.webm?t=1751747668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845950/extras/f708e6282f0193c7b61dce5ce0e8988a.mp4?t=1751747668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Farm of the Unseen is alive, and every decision could be your last. Will you dare to uncover the secrets it hides?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The unseen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange beings inhabit this farm, known as the unseen: enigmatic entities from another time, another world. These beings possess unsettling powers, capable of baffling even the sharpest minds. To face their complex mechanics, you must study them carefully. Each one holds its own story. Perhaps by understanding their turbulent past, you will unravel their mysteries and anticipate their behaviours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845950/extras/85c478ac5d199e2b99d2c4cd66d8b9b5.poster.avif?t=1751747668\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845950/extras/85c478ac5d199e2b99d2c4cd66d8b9b5.webm?t=1751747668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845950/extras/85c478ac5d199e2b99d2c4cd66d8b9b5.mp4?t=1751747668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory:</strong> Collect and utilize a variety of items, codex notes, keys, and gear. The selection of items you come across may differ from what others find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845950/extras/b26bf65007ae26d7e818e1ac3d289275.poster.avif?t=1751747668\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845950/extras/b26bf65007ae26d7e818e1ac3d289275.webm?t=1751747668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845950/extras/b26bf65007ae26d7e818e1ac3d289275.mp4?t=1751747668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845950/extras/3615807b8ae5995513ae3d1c5b65dbcf.poster.avif?t=1751747668\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845950/extras/3615807b8ae5995513ae3d1c5b65dbcf.webm?t=1751747668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845950/extras/3615807b8ae5995513ae3d1c5b65dbcf.mp4?t=1751747668\" type=\"video/mp4\"