    "short_description": "Something is wrong on this farm. Shadows and horrors lurk in its corners, waiting as you uncover buried secrets and solve twisted puzzles. Explore lakes, stables, and fields. Wander through mazes and cursed chambers. The unseen are waiting. They have always known you were coming.",
